<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- SpotBugs ratchet baseline (design doc engineering-rules.md, static-analysis gap fix).
     Excludes the findings that existed when this file was generated, so mvn verify passes today
     but a NEW finding (not listed here) fails the build. Regenerate deliberately with:
       mvn -pl url-shortener-service -am compile spotbugs:spotbugs
